<title>JAPAN: Japan Business Computer rises on higher forecast.</title>
<headline>Japan Business Computer rises on higher forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Japan Business Computer Co Ltd were higher in Tuesday morning trade, due to an upward revision of its earnings forecast, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0040 GMT, the shares were at 1,120 yen, compared to the Monday close of 1,100 yen in over-the-counter trade.  </p>
<p>On Friday, Japan Business said its forecast for parent current profit for the year to March 31, 1997 was 1.75 billion yen. Its previous forecast was 1.3 billion yen.</p>
